    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Click the spin button to get a 5X5 image, which will get chip scores and magnifications according to the pattern. The total score is the product of the score and the multiplier. Special arrangements will produce a &quot;jackpot&quot; that can get extra mini games and extra magnifications . You can increase additional chips and points by pressing the button to buy gems and equipment. As long as you reach a certain score and click the attack button, you can pass the level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Borrowed some of the gameplay of the &quot;Balatro\u201d.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Click the spin button to get a 5X5 image, which will get chip scores and magnifications according to the pattern. The total score is the product of the score and the multiplier. Special arrangements will produce a &quot;jackpot&quot; that can get extra mini games and extra magnifications . You can increase additional chips and points by pressing the button to buy gems and equipment. As long as you reach a certain score and click the attack button, you can pass the level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Borrowed some of the gameplay of the &quot;Balatro\u201d.</p>",
    "short_description": "It is not a traditional Slot machine. Borrowed some of the gameplay of the &quot;Balatro\u201d. You can add various gems and equipment to the Slot machine. Unlimited play, completely free, which can test your luck and put you in a good mood.",
